Qwen3  (Alibaba Cloud, Qwen team)  (MODEL INTERFACE, NOT CODE)
  The native decoder reads the Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B weights (Apache-2.0) at runtime;
  they are not part of this repository (vendor/models/, gitignored). The chat
  template of mormot.ai.infer.chat is written in Pascal; the fixed prompt
  strings the model expects (the ChatML roles and the tool-calling
  instructions) are reproduced from its tokenizer_config.json because the model
  only works with them. Reference data under tests/data/infer-ref/qwen3*
  holds token ids, logits and states computed with the model, no weights.
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B

