gpt-oss  (OpenAI)  (MODEL INTERFACE, NOT CODE)
  The native decoder reads openai/gpt-oss-20b (revision
  6cee5e81ee83917806bbde320786a8fb61efebee) and its GGUF file
  (ggml-org/gpt-oss-20b-GGUF, revision 15dcfc7e7c608c6161507211ed43c5b590801b4b)
  at runtime; they are not part of this
